    "title": "East Ascension wins overtime thriller at St. Amant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Dackiw ,\n1 days ago ST. AMANT - St. Amant vs. East Ascension is seemingly always a nail-biting affair in one of the most well-known rivalries in the state. In the 2026 edition, East Ascension got the win on a walk-off field goal in overtime to win 45-42. Earlier in the week, East Ascension head coach Brock Matherne called the game \"the best rivalry in the state of Louisiana.\" Read full article\n1",
